{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Notice 是一款專注於提升用戶自我覺察的螢幕時間管理工具，適合希望減少無意識滑手機行為的人群。不同於傳統強制封鎖或事後報表，它在您使用 App 時直接顯示即時計時器，讓您當機立斷控制停留時間。目前該應用正進行限時免費活動，原價為 US $2.99。</p>\n\n<h2>即時計時與溫和提醒</h2>\n<p>透過 Shortcuts 自動化設定後，開啟目標 App 即啟動頂部欄計時。每五分鐘發送溫柔通知，十分鐘後計時轉紅警示，二十分鐘可選鬧鐘突破靜音模式。數據僅存本地無須註冊，兼顧隱私與自律，協助您在當下做出停止使用的決定。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-97-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-98-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-99-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-100-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-101-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-102-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Notice – Mindful Screen Time</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T22:18:26.336564+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}